                  "CWE-598"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Credential-like value embedded in URL query"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "torch.load explicitly sets weights_only=False or a framework disables safe model loading. An untrusted artifact may contain executable object deserialization."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Use safe tensor formats or restricted weights-only loading, verify model provenance and integrity, and isolate model conversion workflows."
              },
